Add repository-ignore/pre-commit controls so generated/populated SQL backups are not recommitted.
Add a lightweight CI/review check that rejects populated dump artifacts while allowing approved schema/SP/migration files.
Branch naming
James_Bago is contributor-oriented rather than task/module-oriented. For future implementation work, prefer names such as chore/database-artifact-hygiene, fix/backup-data-governance, or the actual assigned feature/module. This audit does not rename or modify the branch.
Suggested course alignment
DSA W1/W2 — Git/programming review + backend data flow: document the allowed DB artifact boundary and demonstrate schema/SP/migration-only source control with synthetic fixtures and a repository check.
